OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with some sunshine to end the
OL,7,Fday. Remaining dry overnight and with
OL,8,Fclear skies developing and light
OL,9,Fwinds, it will become chilly in places.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,12,Fwith variable cloud and some hazy
OL,13,Fsunny spells. However the cloud may be
OL,14,Fthick enough for the odd spot of rain
OL,15,Fin the morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,18,Fvery warm period with a good deal of
OL,19,Fdry and bright weather. There will
OL,20,Falso be the chance of some showery
OL,21,Fbursts of rain which could be heavy.
